        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአድኀኖ ፡ እምኵሉ ፡ ምንዳቤሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመከራው ፡ ሁሉ ፡ አዳነው ፡ ወንድሞቹ ፡",
